WEBVTT

00:09:57.727 --> 00:10:01.097
If you're told that you are the cause
of context-based anxiety,

00:10:01.131 --> 00:10:03.399
what's the first thing you should do?

00:10:05.502 --> 00:10:11.608
VPG: If you're told that you are the cause
of context-based anxiety,

00:10:11.641 --> 00:10:15.044
remember my face: it's not you,

00:10:15.078 --> 00:10:18.948
it's the situation that you are in.

00:10:18.982 --> 00:10:20.717
Trust your judgment,

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:24.287
particularly if you have
experienced solo status once,

00:10:24.287 --> 00:10:25.755
you've experienced it again.

00:10:25.788 --> 00:10:27.323
If you've been stereotyped once,

00:10:27.357 --> 00:10:29.092
you've probably had this experience

00:10:29.092 --> 00:10:30.260
over and over.